@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = TOKEN

### Listar pedidos (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pedidos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar pedidos (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pedidos/buscar?numero=20261112
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancelar pedido (Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/pedidos/1/cancelar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}